==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# a [[digit]] or [[character]], derived by applying a suitable [[algorithm]] to some [[data]], used to [[check]] whether [[error]]s have occurred in [[transmission]], [[storage]] or [[data entry]]

